(7685327, 1257898, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness Roz.  Thank you for sharing the story behind this image.  While this photo certainly stands on its'' own, I love when words can be put behind it to fill in the details.  In this case it''s difficult read as it tugs strongly at the heart.  I don''t think I''m ready to view Jacob''s life in photos ... the grief those parents must bear.</td>', 'Oh my goodness Roz.  Thank you for sharing the story behind this image.  While this photo certainly stands on its'' own, I love when words can be put behind it to fill in the details.  In this case it''s difficult read as it tugs strongly at the heart.  I don''t think I''m ready to view Jacob''s life in photos ... the grief those parents must bear.', '2021-01-25 10:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
